        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Juan García Ábrego; Juan Nepomuceno Guerra Cárdenas\n- Organizations: Gulf Cartel\n- Places: U.S.-Mexico border\n- Roles: Mexican drug lord; crime lord; bootlegger; businessman; smuggler; founder\n\nFacts:\n- Juan Nepomuceno Guerra Cárdenas was born on July 18, 1915, and died on July 12, 2001.\n- Juan Nepomuceno Guerra Cárdenas was a Mexican crime lord, bootlegger, businessman, and smuggler.\n- Juan Nepomuceno Guerra Cárdenas founded the Gulf Cartel, a drug trafficking organization.\n- Juan Nepomuceno Guerra Cárdenas was reported to be the former head of a criminal dynasty along the U.S.-Mexico border.\n- Juan García Ábrego was born on September 13, 1944.\n- Juan García Ábrego is a former Mexican drug lord.\n- Juan García Ábrego started his criminal career under the tutelage of his uncle, Juan Nepomuceno Guerra Cárdenas.",
